# Dockerfile-specific ignore file; ensures discovery + distributed controller are included
# even if the existing repository's root .dockerignore has restrictive patterns.
.git
**/.git
**/.venv*
**/venv
**/__pycache__
**/.terraform
**/*.tfstate
**/*.tfstate.*
**/*.tfplan
**/terraform.tfvars
**/*.tfvars.json
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*secret*
**/docs
**/tests
**/node_modules
